<<include"OC James NPC Character Menu Avatar Display">>

James Erwin is one of your classmates at Preston Academy. After nervously introducing himself to you one lunchbreak, he has requested help from you to investigate a strange shop located on the boardwalk, One that seems familiar to you but you cannot recall why. Out of curiosity you have agreed to help the boy, But you can’t shake the feeling that you may be getting into something far beyond the confines of your understanding. <br>
<br>
After several failed and embarrassing attempts of trying to enter the mysterious shop, James confesses to you he is looking to speak to someone, a mysterious orange haired boy your age, though you are unsure why, James seems determined to meet him.

